      "description": "Who calls this function or method? Every call site, with confidence and optional depth.\n\nUse for direct and transitive callers; for non-call uses find_references, for blast radius\nimpact. ``depth`` defaults to 1; deeper walks expand only RESOLVED hits, counting the rest\nin ``frontier_skipped_non_resolved``. Filter with ``confidence_tier``, ``exclude_tests``, or\n``arg_position`` + ``arg_is`` (depth 1; ``args_unrecorded`` = sites it could not judge).\n``total_count`` is a lower bound beyond depth 1. ``authoritative: false`` means unlinked\nevidence remains. A non-``ok`` ``reason`` (``bare_name_truncated``,\n``relation_unmodelled_for_language``, ``index_behind``) means the index could not look, not\nthat nobody calls it. ``sign`` adds a ``claim`` line.",
      "input_schema": {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "arg_is": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "enum": [
                  "null",
                  "true",
                  "false",
                  "number",
                  "string",
                  "array",
                  "absent",
                  "dynamic"
                ],
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "default": null
          },
          "arg_name": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "maxLength": 4096,
